:"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","url":"\/documentation\/swami","kind":"symbol","title":"Swami","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI. One helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}]},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/swipeActions(edge:allowsFullSwipe:content:)":{"title":"swipeActions(edge:allowsFullSwipe:content:)","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/swipeactions(edge:allowsfullswipe:content:)","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"swipeActions"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"T"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"edge"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI14HorizontalEdgeO","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"HorizontalEdge"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"allowsFullSwipe"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"content"},{"kind":"text","text":": () -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"T"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kin